===============================================================================
1. CORE PHILOSOPHY
===============================================================================
THE LEXICON is an open-access research terminal dedicated to the forensic audit 
of visual culture. This license is engineered to facilitate global academic 
inquiry and subcultural education while strictly prohibiting the unauthorized 
commercial exploitation of the archival data and taxonomic structures.

===============================================================================
2. PERMISSIONS (OPEN ACCESS)
===============================================================================
Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person to:
- Access, view, and interact with the Terminal for personal, educational, 
  and non-commercial research purposes.
- Share and redistribute the Archival Nodes, provided that full attribution 
  is given to THE LEXICON and the original researcher.
- Use the source code for non-commercial educational projects, provided that 
  such projects also remain Open Access.

===============================================================================
3. RESTRICTIONS (COMMERCIAL & EXTRACIVE USE)
===============================================================================
The following actions are STRICTLY PROHIBITED without a specific, written 
Commercial License granted by the Copyright Holder:
- The use of the Archival Database (database.js), taxonomic nodes, or 
  research notes for commercial gain, trend forecasting services, or 
  corporate strategy.
- The modification or "remixing" of the archive for the purpose of 
  redistributing it as a competing product or service.
- The scraping of archival data for the purpose of training commercial 
  generative AI models without explicit consent.

===============================================================================
4. COMMERCIAL INITIALIZATION
===============================================================================
Entities seeking to utilize THE LEXICON for commercial inquiry, corporate 
auditing, or brand strategy must initialize a Commercial Protocol. 
Contact: info@thelexicon.xyz for licensing initialization.

